  "notes": [
    "Reference mass is not an official measured mass of the user's individual copy.",
    "Catalogued weights carry variation across factories, versions, color, coatings, and scale tolerance.",
    "CX whole-blade mass is a sum of separate chip/main/assist reference masses and may not equal a direct factory unit measurement.",
    "All tip behavior flags describe source-backed qualitative construction. Numeric dynamics multipliers are explicit uncalibrated simulation hypotheses.",
    "Recolored Hasbro/Takara Tomy editions can differ in actual mass; mapped reference masses are for nominal matching designs and may not equal a specific collector edition.",
    "TigaRage FT mainBlade mass 30.9 g is derived from Rage 27.2 g plus Flow 3.7 g reference parts; entire blade 38.4 g includes Lock Chip 1.7 g and Turn 5.8 g. This is NOT a directly weighed BXG-70 physical unit.",
    "TigaRage FT nominal total 47.0 g derived from module references matches an independently published estimated BXG-70 total of 47.0 g; both are estimates, not copies individually weighed.",
    "Two still-unverified weights are the licensed Hasbro Mister Fantastic and Doctor Doom original Blade masses. Do not invent a value; use fallback when selected.",
    "Fort/Wriggle G3084 printed scores were corrected using Hasbro G1682/G1683 package backs, confirmed same moulds. Only EvaBrush BXG-57-03 rating discrepancy remains unresolved."
